# OpenRouter API Key (optional - for AI-powered match explanations)
# Sign up free at https://openrouter.ai → Get API key
# Without this, the app uses a robust deterministic scoring engine
#
# Required in both env vars:
# - OPENROUTER_API_KEY: used by the server-side API route (fallback)
# - NEXT_PUBLIC_OPENROUTER_API_KEY: used by the client-side direct call (primary)
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-your-key-here
NEXT_PUBLIC_OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-your-key-here
